cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "EVO ICL postoperative vault calculator"
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An aggregate-data ophthalmic research workstation with a jointly fitted
  six-feature Ridge model of one-month ICL vault, nested patient-grouped
  validation, a held-out-year test, uncertainty, synthetic scenarios,
  a separate postoperative follow-up experiment and a draft scientific
  poster. Research demonstrator, not for patient care or live clinical use.
authors:
  - family-names: Xia
    given-names: Samuel
repository-code: "https://github.com/samuelxia1004-max/evo-icl-calculator"
url: "https://calculator.evo-icl.cn"
keywords:
  - ophthalmology
  - implantable collamer lens
  - EVO ICL
  - vault prediction
  - research software
